      "display": {
        "tagline": "❌ CONFIRMED long-context memory-safety failure — do not use above ~28K tokens",
        "good_for": "Only short/moderate-context coding tasks (well under ~28K prompt tokens) until root-caused. Do NOT use for large-repo or long-session work despite its architectural 262,144-token ceiling — real testing found that ceiling is not safely reachable on this server/quantization combination.",
